  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Use Brazilian Portuguese for all UI labels, headings, instructions and toasts.",
    "Implement Lenis smooth scrolling for luxury editorial feel.",
    "Add countdown timer component counting down to October 31, 2026.",
    "Ensure Product Modal offers 3 clear actions: 'Comprar no Mercado Livre', 'Comprar na Magalu', and 'Presentear via PIX' (with copy key button and QR code aesthetic).",
    "Allow guests to toggle 'Marcar como presenteado' with guest name input so the carousel items show reserved badge.",
    "Admin section should allow Filipi & Larissa to manage gifts (add/edit/delete/toggle reserved), view RSVP list with companion count, and configure PIX key & party details.",
